Padre Nuestro, Pater Noster and Ave María
  Holy See, "Compendio del Catecismo de la Iglesia Católica" (2005), Spanish
  edition, Apéndice A, "Oraciones comunes".
  Copied from https://www.vatican.va/archive/compendium_ccc/documents/archive_2005_compendium-ccc_sp.html
  The same Padre Nuestro is on https://www.vaticannews.va/es/oraciones/padre-nuestro.html
  and the same Ave María on https://www.vaticannews.va/es/oraciones/ave-maria.html
  © Copyright 2005 - Libreria Editrice Vaticana
  Traditional prayers; the Latin Pater Noster is in the public domain.
  The Pater Noster is the Spanish edition's (unaccented, "quotidianum", ending
  "Amen"), not the English edition's accented one, which ends without "Amen".

