Secuencia de Pentecostés
  Holy See, "Compendio del Catecismo de la Iglesia Católica" (2005),
  Apéndice A, "Ven Santo Espíritu"; the same text as the Spanish Lectionary
  (Conferencia Episcopal Española, Leccionario I (C), Domingo de Pentecostés).
  Copied from https://www.vatican.va/archive/compendium_ccc/documents/archive_2005_compendium-ccc_sp.html
  The same text is on https://www.vaticannews.va/es/oraciones/ven-santo-espiritu.html
  and https://www.conferenciaepiscopal.es/liturgia/cpentecostes.pdf
  © Copyright 2005 - Libreria Editrice Vaticana
